# Totentanz, Swarm Piper: "{1}{B}: Target attacking Rat you control gains deathtouch until end of turn." Turn one Bot1 plays
# Totentanz, a Memnite and an Ornithopter; on turn two Bot2 plays a Hill Giant and Bolts the Memnite and the Ornithopter (two Rats
# from nontoken creatures dying). On turn three Rat Token#1 attacks and the Giant blocks it. The ability refuses the Rat that stays
# home (not attacking) and Totentanz (no Rat), and Bot2's Giant (not yours); with Rat Token#1 as the target it gains deathtouch, so
# the Rat dies to the Giant's 3 damage but kills it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Ornithopter
Totentanz, Swarm Piper
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
